{"template": "12和18的相同因数是它们的公因数，其中最大的一个是它们的最大公因数。{a}和{b}的公因数有____，最大公因数是____。", "slots": {"a": {"type": "int", "min": 2, "max": 99}, "b": {"type": "int", "min": 2, "max": 99}}, "constraints": ["a != b", "a < b"], "verifiable_type": "program", "solver": "from math import gcd

