{"template": "为了庆祝节日，学校按“{pattern_text}”的规律循环悬挂彩旗。请问：第{n}面彩旗是什么颜色？", "slots": {"pattern_text": {"type": "choice", "options": ["红、黄、蓝", "红、红、黄、黄", "红、黄、蓝、绿"]}, "n": {"type": "int", "min": 10, "max": 99}}, "constraints": [], "verifiable_type": "program", "solver": "def solve(pattern_text, n):
    colors = pattern_text.split('、')
